#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:344
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Chances are you are using an NVidia GPU. Due to a bug in Nvidia's driver "
#| "that we haven't been able to workaround yet, sometimes Krita's window "
#| "will be transparent or semi-transparent. The solution is to enable the "
#| "Angle renderer in Krita's Settings dialog. Open the :menuselection:"
#| "`Settings` menu (Press Alt-N if the menubar is not visible and your "
